# ============================================================
# 12. FDR CORRECTION
# ============================================================
#
# BH correction across all six indirect-effect tests:
#
# TCGA:
#   FA metabolism -> G2/M -> HR
#   FA metabolism -> G2/M -> NHEJ
#   FA metabolism -> G2/M -> DSB
#
# GSE76427:
#   FA metabolism -> G2/M -> HR
#   FA metabolism -> G2/M -> NHEJ
#   FA metabolism -> G2/M -> DSB
# ============================================================

